00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:20.000
You know, why, why'd you make that choice?

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.379
Silicon Valley was something-

00:04:21.379 --> 00:04:22.770
&gt;&gt; Yeah.
&gt;&gt; Then but it's not what it is today.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:25.120
Sequoia was good but it's not what it is
today.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.840
What drove you to come back here, what did
